  "goodToKnow": "Die Energieeffizienz is energy efficiency: die Energieeffizienzklasse of appliances (EU labels A to G, rescaled in 2021), energieeffizientes Bauen. When renting or buying in Germany, landlords must show a Energieausweis (energy performance certificate). The Gebäudeenergiegesetz (Heating Act) of 2023 aims to make heating more efficient and climate-friendly. Note the double e. It has no plural."
